cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Argus"
abstract: >-
  Argus is a project manager for library special collections and archives.
  Library staff and researchers can create lists of bibliographic records
  imported from a connected Ex Libris Alma/Primo catalog and/or from
  ArchivesSpace, associate item records, and generate pull slips.
authors:
  - name: "Argus Archives Project"
    affiliation: "Miami University Libraries"
repository-code: "https://github.com/argus4archives/Argus"
license: MIT
version: "0.9.1"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
keywords:
  - archives
  - special collections
  - library
  - Alma
  - ArchivesSpace
